      "name": "brewcode",
      "description": "Brewcode - Claude Code authoring toolkit: skill, agent and rule creation and sync, semantic code search (semble), project conventions, E2E tests, generated review and domain-team skills, setup dashboard, post-compact plan re-anchor",
      "version": "6.12.0",
      "category": "productivity",
